# synth-containers changelog

## 2026-09-09 — consolidation candidate

* Prepare unpublished `0.4.3`, combining production API/metadata/journal contracts with the v0.10 runtime, CISPO, annotations, tunnel streaming and trace artifact fixes.
* Preserve immutable published `0.4.2`; consumers must re-pin only after the replacement package passes release gates.
* Scan in-memory event logs for credentials before publication; retain inspection-server cleanup on exceptional exit.
* Raise runtime Starlette/IDNA and development cryptography/urllib3 security floors; update FastAPI compatibly and replace vulnerable locked versions identified by all 12 current Dependabot alerts.

## 2026-09-09

* Published stable `0.4.2` from the original release lane; these bytes remain immutable.
* Fixed Python 3.11 attempt serialization and scheduler startup/recovery races.
* Release CI now enforces lint and rejects new signatures beyond documented type debt.
* Restored the complete publish test gate, including missing/scored reward recovery.
* `0.4.2.dev20260909`: made the declared `ruff check src` gate pass; the eleven
  `harbor_environment` re-exports missing from `__all__` were a public-surface
  bug, not a style nit.
* Added `pytest` to the dev dependencies and to the documented release gate. The
  package had no test runner in any declared dependency.
* Regenerated `uv.lock`, which still named `0.4.2.dev20260903`.

## 2026-08-21

* Prepared `0.4.1` as the official Containers package for Workshop v0.7.
* Included the promoted Banking77 and GSM8K contracts, hosted sampler fixes, and immutable Trace V5 receipts from `main`.

## 2026-08-14

* Prepared `0.4.1.dev20260814` as the Workshop v0.3 development-channel Containers substrate.
* Included the merged platform, tunnel credential rotation, Harbor authoring, verifier, and immutable local-build registration work from `dev`.

## 2026-08-13

* Added a no-argument command that registers immutable local development builds for Workshop.
* Added `synth-trace version` so consumers can verify the exact installed package contract.

## 2026-06-04

* Published `0.2.0.20260604` to PyPI (first non-dev daily release).
* Added checkpoint export/import routes and a `resume_async` rollout route.

## 2026-05-31

* Published `0.2.0.dev202605312141` to PyPI.
* Added public `Container` authoring facade.
* Added `Container.serve()` for local context-managed serving.
* Added `ContainerRunner` for SDK containers, FastAPI apps, shell commands, and URLs.
* Added `ContainerHandle.connection()` and immutable `ContainerConnection`.
* Defaulted SDK-authored containers to async rollout submission.
* Added async rollout polling through `/rollouts/{rollout_id}`.
* Exported `Container`, `ContainerHandle`, `ContainerConnection`, and `ContainerRunner`.
* Kept handwritten FastAPI containers and `create_reference_app()` compatible.
* Merged [PR #2](https://github.com/synth-laboratories/containers/pull/2) `better-ai-auth`; [PR #1](https://github.com/synth-laboratories/containers/pull/1) `better-sdk` remains the SDK base.
* Lifecycle APIs stay optimizer-neutral; GEPA appears only in metadata contracts.

## 2026-05-30

* No main-branch package release.
* Better SDK container lifecycle work stayed staged off main.
* Next release target: cleaner examples, acceptance evidence, and lockstep optimizer docs.
